      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do u mean by goblin merchant?? i'm just asking about a standard logistics contract. can u please just give me the actual professional breakdown without the weird stuff? \n\nalso, regarding the insurance part, does the seller get to choose whatever policy they want? like, is there a minimum level of coverage they have to provide under CIF 2020?",
      "source": "evaluator"
