      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm a bit confused on the coverage part though. if there's no specific minimum, wouldn't that mean the seller could just get the absolute bare minimum insurance to save money, even if it doesn't actually cover much? i thought i read something about Institute Cargo Clauses (C) being the standard minimum for CIF? can u check if that's actually a requirement or if they can just do whatever they want?",
